WEBVTT

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:05.130
There was a fight with
unarmed sumo wrestlers?

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.980
Why’d they do that?

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.750
If only I didn’t take my
eyes off of Serizawa-san...

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.200
It wasn’t our fault.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.830
Seriously, they were the
ones who started it.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:56.010
And we couldn’t openly
defy a chief’s orders.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.240
I don’t give a shit
about your excuses!

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.020
So what if they picked a fight!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:02.740
Why the hell did you draw your
sword against unarmed men?!

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:06.760
Then I’ll split open
my gut for straying

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.270
from the way of the warrior.

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.770
Souji, what’s gotten into you?!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.420
This is no time for jokes!

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.280
What joke?

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.030
I’m dead serious.

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.160
Give it a rest, Souji!

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:25.140
Spilling your guts ain’t
gonna resolve this issue!

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:34.170
Oath Made on the Wind
Blowing Over the Grass

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.190
This was by no means our fault.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.790
When a samurai is humiliated,

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:42.770
he must be willing to fight,

00:02:42.770 --> 00:02:44.180
even if it means death.

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:45.750
Like hell!

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:48.830
You’re pulling the same
crap as those rogue samurai!

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:51.560
The Osaka magistrate has recognized

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.690
that they were killed
for their insolence.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.540
The sumo stable’s coach
has even apologized.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.260
This incident is already behind us.

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:03.510
You bastard!

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:05.950
Why the hell did
you leave Edo to come here?!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:10.670
Then allow me to ask
you the same, Hijikata.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:14.460
Why, exactly, are you here?

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:16.900
Ain’t it obvious?!

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:18.720
I’m here to make Kondou-san the

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:21.040
head warrior in the
fight for a just cause.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.430
No matter how far you
bring him up in the world,

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.240
a farmer will always be nothing
more than a mere farmer.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:30.660
That is the way of the world.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.140
What?!

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:34.980
I’ve said this before,

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:40.050
but you lack the resolve
to dirty yourself

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.730
and play the villain if that is what

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.860
it takes to achieve your goals.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:47.390
If you want to succeed
as a true warrior,

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:51.020
Hijikata, you must become a devil!

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:55.750
It matters not if people detest you

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.570
and everyone turns against you.

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.380
If you can become a devil,

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:07.120
you may be able to prevail
over the ways of the world.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.370
A devil...

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.250
Toshi...

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:18.020
Hey.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:23.070
Serizawa-san landed into me again.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.610
He says I lack the resolve
to abandon everything.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:31.350
It’s true I can’t do what he does.

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:35.210
He does whatever it takes to raise
the Roshigumi’s renown,

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.000
unafraid of how it mars his reputation.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.980
I can’t do that, either.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:42.570
Serizawa-san must have
been truly born a samurai.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:46.970
Are you saying that we
can never become samurai?

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:50.660
We cannot become the type of
samurai Serizawa-san describes.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.560
That’s what I meant.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:01.420
This area is somewhat
reminiscent of Tama.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.720
Say, doesn’t this remind
you of the old days?

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.330
You’ve improved lately.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.730
I’m still no match for you.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:41.300
But really, Toshi, you’re amazing!

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.050
You always make sure to attend
practice between work.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.970
What’s so amazing?

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:51.140
I’ve never seen something
through to the end, not once.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.890
I’m a hopeless loser.

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.100
I don’t want to inherit my family farm

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:58.590
and did a half-hearted job on my

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.480
apprenticeship before hightailing it.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:05.010
I only reluctantly peddle
that so I can eat.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.980
It just so happens that none of
that was a good match for you.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:11.200
Put differently, there is something
else you want to do, isn’t there?

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.640
Something I want to do...?

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.390
Do you have something?

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.620
Huh? Me?

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:22.140
I want to save the weak and be true to

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:23.800
the way of the warrior.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:26.400
I’d like to become
a general like Kanko.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:32.680
Oh, er, I’ve looked up to
him ever since I was a kid.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.070
My father often told me about the

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:36.970
Romance of the Three Kingdoms.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.080
Isn’t it funny?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.680
A farmer dreaming of becoming a general.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.690
No, I’m the same way.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:47.800
I want to become a samurai...

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.600
A true samurai.

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.780
This is the day and age where foreigners

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:56.210
come to Japan on boats as big as whales!

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.810
Incredible stuff is happening
one thing after the next.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:05.140
In these times, maybe a
farmer CAN become a samurai!

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:06.250
I see.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.780
So we share the same goal, Toshi.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:18.300
That was the first time I
ever told someone my dream.

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.320
Kondou-san, you inherited the Shieikan

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.330
and truly did become a warrior.

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.720
And you, Toshi, wear a katana

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.390
and short sword like a samurai.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.650
There is no need to
imitate Serizawa-san.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:33.120
There must be something that we can do

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.610
because we weren’t born samurai...

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.090
because we’re us.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:38.850
You’re right.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.390
Are you Ibuki-kun?

00:07:55.890 --> 00:08:00.000
Oh, aren’t you that new guy, uh...?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.410
Yamazaki.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.750
I want to cut to the
chase and ask you something.

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:07.680
I heard that you aren’t
a member of the corps,

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.760
so what is keeping you here?

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:15.030
Er, it’s because Serizawa-san
won’t let me to leave.

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:16.720
That’s it?

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:19.260
Isn’t there some other reason?

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.770
Not really...

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:28.000
Allow me to give you a warning.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:29.810
If you plan to leave eventually,

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:31.130
you should do so soon.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:36.140
Yamazaki, got a second?

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:36.780
Sir!

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.980
There is but one reason
why I summoned you here.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:45.860
I was thinking it’s time
to put a bell on the cat.

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.230
Heisuke, you alone?

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.060
Ryunosuke!

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:05.330
Yeah, everyone’s hiding
out in their rooms.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.500
It looks like that mess in
Osaka hit ’em pretty hard.

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:14.490
Say, Heisuke, remember how you had a

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.870
little chat with Kodo-san the other day?

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:19.830
Huh? Oh, you saw that?

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:23.950
When two adamant wills clash,
fighting is the only option.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:28.480
Even so, if possible...
I don’t want to kill someone

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:29.960
if I don’t have to.

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.570
I think it’d be great if
I never had to kill anyone.

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:37.740
You put a lot of serious thought
into stuff, don’t you?

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.100
I have new-earned respect for you.

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:41.990
What brought this on?

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:45.040
I may have said a bunch
of things to Kodo-san,

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.100
but I’m still pretty naive...

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:52.610
No, I really thought that
you’ve got your act together.

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.860
Dang, I don’t know what to say.

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.490
If you’re gonna say crud like that,

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.890
I’m gonna take this!

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:02.910
Hey!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.720
Cut it out! Give that back!

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:08.960
That’s Serizawa-san’s saké!

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.470
What do you have to report?

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:21.330
We have decided to create
a new post: Inspectors.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:23.950
I plan to have Shimada and Yamazaki,

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.480
who have recently joined,
fill the position.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:28.980
Inspectors?

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:32.860
They will investigate matters both
within and without the Roshigumi.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:35.860
You’re going to have them watch us?!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:38.380
That’s not necessarily the plan.

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:41.340
We have secrets that we do
not want the men to learn of,

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:43.550
such as the furies and
the Water of Life.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:46.110
The goal is also to
investigate whether or

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:48.370
not there are enemy spies amongst us.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.380
You have no reason to object, do you?

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.510
Do as you like.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.260
Sensei, are you sure about this?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:08.460
Aren’t they trying to entrap us...?

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.880
That is hardly something new.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:15.710
Ever since the Honjou Inn incident,

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.020
that man has been bent on killing me.

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:18.990
What?!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.820
Yukimura-dono! It’s Niimi.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.870
Were you in the middle
of writing a letter?

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:55.130
I am terribly sorry to
visit without warning.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.750
It’s fine. This is not
of an urgent nature.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.680
It is merely a letter
to my daughter in Edo.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:07.720
Things in the Roshigumi are
becoming most frustrating.

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:11.020
I came to visit you while I
can still move about freely.

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.700
So, do you have it?

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.370
It is still in the trial stages.

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:23.480
I carefully selected a liquid that could

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.930
be used to dilute the Water of Life.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.910
Thank you very much.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:31.930
I shall test it right away.

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:34.310
Be certain not to tell

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:37.790
Sannan-kun or the men from
the Roshigumi of this.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.260
I’m surprised he has a daughter.

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:46.780
I can never read that man’s thoughts.

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.050
Forcing others to lend you
money is unpardonable!

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:59.960
Take him to headquarters!

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:01.400
C’mon. Get up.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.530
He put on quite the show.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:08.840
At a glance, it would appear

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:11.390
he has cracked down
on a rogue samurai...

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.480
Thank you so much.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:17.630
But it would seem he was
after something else as well.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.080
What was that?!

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:57.330
It came from out back!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.900
Ryunosuke, what happened? You okay?

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:09.790
Hijikata-san!

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:15.660
Where did he go?!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:19.610
After him!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.710
Souji! Sannan-san!

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:25.400
You saw him, right?
What did he look like?

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:27.570
Uh, well...

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:29.680
You’re coming too!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:30.550
H-hey!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.060
Do-do you need something?

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.890
Don’t play dumb!

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.560
That was a fury’s voice.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:43.090
Want to die?

00:14:45.840 --> 00:14:48.940
Why all this fuss in the
middle of the night?

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:50.070
You’re making a commotion.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:58.890
I-I was just testing the Water of Life.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:00.980
Who did you administer it to?

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:03.090
Not one of our own.

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:06.090
I used the ronin
that Serizawa-sensei arrested.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:10.090
Niimi-san, why did you do
that without consulting us?

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.080
I did it to improve our results faster!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:16.970
Plus, it wasn’t a COMPLETE
failure this time.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.250
He was able to retain
his senses at first.

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.920
But ultimately, you
allowed a monster that

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:25.440
will indiscriminately
attack people break free.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:27.480
How will you take
responsibility for this?

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:29.680
E-even if you wanted me
to take responsibility...

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:32.090
Henceforth!

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:37.270
I will not keep my peace if you
sneak something behind our backs again.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.600
Breaking the Code is punishable
by honorable suicide!

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:41.870
Don’t forget that.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:45.470
I-I will be sure to bear that in mind.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.770
Heisuke, that’s him!

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:11.900
Ryunosuke, stay back!

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:26.920
It healed--!

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.700
Ryunosuke!

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:53.720
You damn monster!

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.220
Heisuke!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.340
Wait!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.280
Damn it!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.740
I see. So you let it escape...

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.900
At any rate, he can’t
move during the day.

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.250
He should be in hiding somewhere.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.570
Continue your patrols throughout
the day like normal.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:54.990
Don’t let the other members catch on.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:59.020
The true race will begin
once the sun sets.

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:01.760
I shall join you tonight.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.770
Hijikata-san, I’m sorry!

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.900
N-no! It’s my fault that Heisuke--

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:11.040
I hesitated!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:14.900
Even though he’s a monster,
he was once a person.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.340
He wasn’t someone I originally
would have killed...

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:24.910
That hesitation could lead
to even more victims.

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:30.240
Heisuke, there won’t be a second time.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.950
Heisuke, it’s about time.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:43.960
Yeah...

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:47.080
What is it?

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:52.000
I was thinking back to not so long ago.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.440
To when you were in Edo?

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.850
I first met guys who I could call pals

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:58.950
when I went to the Shieikan.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:01.070
It made me so happy...

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:05.430
But the dojo was poor--totally broke.

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:07.310
That’s why I came to Kyoto.

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:10.390
I was confident everyone
could be happy here.

00:19:10.850 --> 00:19:13.190
That everything would go well.

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:17.460
I have to firm my resolve
for that to ever happen.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:25.480
Outsiders must not learn of
the Bakufu’s secret elixir.

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:28.300
And we cannot allow people to
fall victim to the fury’s hands.

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:30.440
We will finish things tonight.

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:31.580
You got that?

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:32.510
Yeah!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.550
Heisuke, please take me with you!

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:37.480
Ryunosuke...

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:40.590
I’m partly responsible
for him getting away.

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:43.870
And couldn’t you use
an extra pair of eyes?

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.490
Yeah, but...

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.230
Got it.

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:52.590
But in exchange, please
do whatever I tell you.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.020
No matter what, don’t
do anything risky!

00:19:55.020 --> 00:19:56.130
Okay!

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:06.810
Over there!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.300
Ryunosuke, look after that lady.

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:52.580
I have to fight...

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:22.610
Heisuke, are you okay?

00:21:22.610 --> 00:21:25.280
Yeah... How’s the lady?

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:28.600
She just passed out.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.750
Thank God...

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:36.630
Ryunosuke, I chose to walk
the way of the warrior.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:42.590
I will cut down any who
stand against my beliefs.

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:46.210
So I am going to continue to

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:48.560
kill, to kill and to kill...

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:51.020
But will I ever

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:53.580
grow accustomed to this...?

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:29.070
Ibuki, I will instruct you.

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:30.530
Nah, I’m fine...

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:33.950
There’s no need to teach
Ryunosuke swordsmanship.

00:23:33.990 --> 00:23:36.460
If Ryunosuke’s trying to change,

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:38.140
why not let him?

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:40.690
The Shackles of Pandemonium
